class="flex w-[82vw] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col sm:w-[60vw] lg:h-full lg:w-[38vw]" data-sig-card="true"><div class="relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] bg-forest lg:aspect-auto lg:min-h-0 lg:flex-1" data-sig-frame="true"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 -left-[12%] w-[124%]" data-sig-image="true"><img alt="A fairway bending left around a grove of ancient umbrella pines in early morning light" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 640px) 72vw, 98vw" src="/images/golf-hole-pines.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/90 via-pine/10 to-pine/30"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] sm:p-5 sm:text-[11px]"><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/30 px-3 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-sm">Hole <!-- -->04</span><span class="pt-1.5 text-bone/80">Stroke index <!-- -->7</span></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-4 sm:p-6"><p class="font-serif text-[clamp(4rem,7vw,7.5rem)] leading-[0.8]" data-sig-detail="true">04</p><h3 class="type-wide mt-3 text-[clamp(1.4rem,2.2vw,2.1rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none" data-sig-detail="true">The Pines</h3><p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/80" data-sig-detail="true">Par <!-- -->4<!-- --> · <!-- -->412<!-- --> yds</p></div></div><div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:gap-6"><p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone/70" data-sig-detail="true">A dogleg left that bends around a stand of two-hundred-year-old umbrella pines. Take them on and a wedge remains; play away and a long iron finds a shelf green tucked into the forest edge.</p><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre sm:max-w-[9rem] sm:text-right" data-sig-detail="true">Carry over the corner: 238 yds</p></div></article><article aria-label="Hole 7, Quarry" class="flex w-[82vw] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col sm:w-[60vw] lg:h-full lg:w-[38vw]" data-sig-card="true"><div class="relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] bg-forest lg:aspect-auto lg:min-h-0 lg:flex-1" data-sig-frame="true"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 -left-[12%] w-[124%]" data-sig-image="true"><img alt="A par three green framed by the cut rock walls of an old stone quarry" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 640px) 72vw, 98vw" src="/images/golf-hole-quarry.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/90 via-pine/10 to-pine/30"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] sm:p-5 sm:text-[11px]"><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/30 px-3 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-sm">Hole <!-- -->07</span><span class="pt-1.5 text-bone/80">Stroke index <!-- -->15</span></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-4 sm:p-6"><p class="font-serif text-[clamp(4rem,7vw,7.5rem)] leading-[0.8]" data-sig-detail="true">07</p><h3 class="type-wide mt-3 text-[clamp(1.4rem,2.2vw,2.1rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none" data-sig-detail="true">Quarry</h3><p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/80" data-sig-detail="true">Par <!-- -->3<!-- --> · <!-- -->187<!-- --> yds</p></div></div><div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:gap-6"><p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone/70" data-sig-detail="true">The tee sits on the lip of a quarry that supplied stone to the region for three centuries. The green is framed by the rock face itself, so a missed shot is simply gone.</p><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre sm:max-w-[9rem] sm:text-right" data-sig-detail="true">Carry to the front: 164 yds</p></div></article><article aria-label="Hole 11, Long Heath" class="flex w-[82vw] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col sm:w-[60vw] lg:h-full lg:w-[38vw]" data-sig-card="true"><div class="relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] bg-forest lg:aspect-auto lg:min-h-0 lg:flex-1" data-sig-frame="true"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 -left-[12%] w-[124%]" data-sig-image="true"><img alt="A long fairway through flowering coastal heath rolling toward the ocean" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 640px) 72vw, 98vw" src="/images/golf-hole-heath.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/90 via-pine/10 to-pine/30"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] sm:p-5 sm:text-[11px]"><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/30 px-3 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-sm">Hole <!-- -->11</span><span class="pt-1.5 text-bone/80">Stroke index <!-- -->4</span></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-4 sm:p-6"><p class="font-serif text-[clamp(4rem,7vw,7.5rem)] leading-[0.8]" data-sig-detail="true">11</p><h3 class="type-wide mt-3 text-[clamp(1.4rem,2.2vw,2.1rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none" data-sig-detail="true">Long Heath</h3><p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/80" data-sig-detail="true">Par <!-- -->5<!-- --> · <!-- -->568<!-- --> yds</p></div></div><div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:gap-6"><p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone/70" data-sig-detail="true">The longest hole on the estate crosses open heathland in flower from March to June. Three disciplined shots, a patient putter, and the ocean in view the whole way.</p><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre sm:max-w-[9rem] sm:text-right" data-sig-detail="true">Heath in flower: March to June</p></div></article><article aria-label="Hole 16, Mirror" class="flex w-[82vw] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col sm:w-[60vw] lg:h-full lg:w-[38vw]" data-sig-card="true"><div class="relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] bg-forest lg:aspect-auto lg:min-h-0 lg:flex-1" data-sig-frame="true"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 -left-[12%] w-[124%]" data-sig-image="true"><img alt="A peninsula green on a still reservoir at dawn, its flag reflected in the water" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 640px) 72vw, 98vw" src="/images/golf-hole-mirror.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/90 via-pine/10 to-pine/30"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] sm:p-5 sm:text-[11px]"><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/30 px-3 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-sm">Hole <!-- -->16</span><span class="pt-1.5 text-bone/80">Stroke index <!-- -->16</span></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-4 sm:p-6"><p class="font-serif text-[clamp(4rem,7vw,7.5rem)] leading-[0.8]" data-sig-detail="true">16</p><h3 class="type-wide mt-3 text-[clamp(1.4rem,2.2vw,2.1rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none" data-sig-detail="true">Mirror</h3><p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/80" data-sig-detail="true">Par <!-- -->3<!-- --> · <!-- -->164<!-- --> yds</p></div></div><div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:gap-6"><p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone/70" data-sig-detail="true">A peninsula green reaching into the reservoir with water on three sides. On still mornings the flag appears twice, once in the air and once in the water.</p><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre sm:max-w-[9rem] sm:text-right" data-sig-detail="true">Green depth: 28 yds</p></div></article><article aria-label="Hole 18, The Return" class="flex w-[82vw] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col sm:w-[60vw] lg:h-full lg:w-[38vw]" data-sig-card="true"><div class="relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] bg-forest lg:aspect-auto lg:min-h-0 lg:flex-1" data-sig-frame="true"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 -left-[12%] w-[124%]" data-sig-image="true"><img alt="The final green below a low rammed earth clubhouse with a long timber roof, glowing at dusk" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 46vw, (min-width: 640px) 72vw, 98vw" src="/images/golf-hole-return.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/90 via-pine/10 to-pine/30"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 p-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] sm:p-5 sm:text-[11px]"><span class="rounded-full border border-bone/30 px-3 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-sm">Hole <!-- -->18</span><span class="pt-1.5 text-bone/80">Stroke index <!-- -->6</span></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-4 sm:p-6"><p class="font-serif text-[clamp(4rem,7vw,7.5rem)] leading-[0.8]" data-sig-detail="true">18</p><h3 class="type-wide mt-3 text-[clamp(1.4rem,2.2vw,2.1rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none" data-sig-detail="true">The Return</h3><p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/80" data-sig-detail="true">Par <!-- -->4<!-- --> · <!-- -->461<!-- --> yds</p></div></div><div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:gap-6"><p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-bone/70" data-sig-detail="true">Uphill toward the clubhouse, where the terrace watches every approach. A generous fairway and a fiercely contoured green make it a hole of nerve.</p><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre sm:max-w-[9rem] sm:text-right" data-sig-detail="true">Climbs 21 m to the green</p></div></article><div class="flex w-[70vw] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col justify-end gap-6 sm:w-[40vw] lg:w-[24vw] lg:pb-4"><p class="font-serif text-[clamp(1.8rem,2.6vw,2.6rem)] leading-[1.1] text-bone/90">Thirteen more, and not one of them filler.</p><a class="inline-flex h-12 w-fit items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-bone/30 px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] transition-colors hover:border-bone hover:bg-bone hover:text-charcoal" href="#course-map">See the full routing<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="mx-5 mb-10 h-px bg-bone/15 sm:mx-8 lg:mx-12 lg:mb-10"><span class="block h-full origin-left scale-x-0 bg-ochre"></span></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="short-nine-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-sand text-charcoal" id="short-nine"><div class="grid items-center gap-12 px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-28"><figure class="lg:col-span-7"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand aspect-[4/3] rounded-[4px] lg:aspect-[5/4]" data-mask="left"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="8"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="A flagstick on an immaculate green above the bay as the sun sets behind the mountains" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 58vw, 100vw" src="/images/campaign/green-at-sunset.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:80% center;color:transparent"/></div></div></div><figcaption class="mt-3 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground">The Short Nine at last light</figcaption></figure><div class="lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/55">Beyond the eighteen</p><h2 class="mt-5 text-[clamp(2rem,3.4vw,3.3rem)] font-light leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.03em] [&amp;_em]:font-serif [&amp;_em]:font-normal" id="short-nine-heading">The Short Nine, <em>under the lights.</em></h2><p class="mt-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/75" data-reveal="true">Nine par threes from 68 to 142 yards, floodlit until eleven at night. It is where first rounds are played, where members settle bets after dinner and where the best short-iron players on the estate are made.</p><ul class="mt-8 border-t border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><li class="border-b py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] border-charcoal/10 text-charcoal/70">9 holes, par 27</li><li class="border-b py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] border-charcoal/10 text-charcoal/70">68 to 142 yards</li><li class="border-b py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] border-charcoal/10 text-charcoal/70">Floodlit until 23:00</li></ul><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4" data-reveal="true"><button class="inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] transition-colors duration-300 bg-charcoal text-bone hover:bg-forest" type="button">Book the Short Nine<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="practice-ground-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-bone text-charcoal" id="practice-ground"><div class="grid items-center gap-12 px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-28"><figure class="lg:col-span-7 lg:order-2 lg:col-start-6"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand aspect-[4/3] rounded-[4px] lg:aspect-[5/4]" data-mask="right"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="8"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="A golfer mid-swing in a covered range bay at dusk, with the floodlit range stretching beyond" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 58vw, 100vw" src="/images/golf-academy-range.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div></div></div><figcaption class="mt-3 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground">The range bays at dusk</figcaption></figure><div class="lg:col-span-4 lg:order-1 lg:col-start-1"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/55">Before the round</p><h2 class="mt-5 text-[clamp(2rem,3.4vw,3.3rem)] font-light leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.03em] [&amp;_em]:font-serif [&amp;_em]:font-normal" id="practice-ground-heading">Warm up where <em>every shot is measured.</em></h2><p class="mt-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/75" data-reveal="true">The range, short game park and putting lab sit five minutes from the first tee. Forty-eight tracked bays tell you exactly how far each club is flying today, before the course asks you to choose.</p><ul class="mt-8 border-t border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><li class="border-b py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] border-charcoal/10 text-charcoal/70">48 tracked bays</li><li class="border-b py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] border-charcoal/10 text-charcoal/70">3 ha short game park</li><li class="border-b py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] border-charcoal/10 text-charcoal/70">Indoor putting lab</li></ul><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4" data-reveal="true"><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em]" href="/morrow-original/academy"><span class="relative py-1">Explore the Academy<span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-px origin-left bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:scale-x-0 group-hover:origin-right"></span></span><span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-current/30 transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:border-current"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="playing-morrow-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-forest text-bone" id="playing-morrow"><div class="px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-32"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-bone/70"><span class="tabular-nums">05</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Playing Morrow</span></p><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.1rem,4.2vw,4.2rem)] font-light leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em] [&amp;_em]:font-serif [&amp;_em]:font-normal" id="playing-morrow-heading">Everything to know <em>before the first tee.</em></h2></div><p class="self-end text-base leading-relaxed lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9 text-bone/70" data-reveal="true">Tee times, caddies, carts and the few simple rules that keep a round here unhurried.</p></div><ol class="mt-14 grid gap-x-8 gap-y-12 lg:mt-20 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-bone/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-bone/45">01</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">Tee times</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">Members book twenty-one days ahead and guests fourteen, with twelve minutes between every group.</p><p class="mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre">Tee sheet from 07:00</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-bone/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-bone/45">02</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">Caddies</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">Forecaddies who know every break on every green, available for any round on the Championship 18.</p><p class="mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre">Request with your tee time</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-bone/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-bone/45">03</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">Carts</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">Electric carts with course GPS, kept to the paths across the heathland holes to protect the turf.</p><p class="mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre">Walking always welcome</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-bone/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-bone/45">04</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">Pace of play</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">A round here takes four hours and ten minutes. Our marshals quietly help keep it that way.</p><p class="mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre">4 h 10 min</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-bone/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-bone/45">05</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">Dress</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">Collared shirts, tailored shorts or trousers and soft spikes on the course. The clubhouse is relaxed.</p><p class="mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre">Smart casual indoors</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-bone/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-bone/45">06</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">Handicaps</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">Visitors play the Championship tees with a handicap of 24 or better. The forward tees are open to all.</p><p class="mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ochre">Certificate on arrival</p></li></ol></div></section><section aria-label="Next page" class="relative z-10 bg-charcoal"><a class="group relative block h-[78svh] min-h-[440px] overflow-hidden text-bone" href="/morrow-original/clubhouse"><div class="overflow-hidden absolute inset-0 h-full w-full bg-pine"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="10"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><img alt="The modern clubhouse with its long flat roof and glowing glass, a row of carts and an olive tree in front" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-[1800ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)]